{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The first <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME\" title=\"Mock AIME\">Mock AIME</a> ever on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> was written by AoPS community member Mildorf and was called the <b>Mock AIME</b> at the time it was administered.  Now it is known by the Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Entire Exam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005/Answer_Key\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005/Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME\" title=\"Mock AIME\">Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14491\">Initial Discussion</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14682\">Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Results/Discussion/Solutions</a>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.tjhsst.edu/~tmildorf/math/PracticeAIMESolutions.pdf\">Soluti